-- 010: fix garbled provider names and cities from the state list.
--
-- The December 2025 import ran the state list's two columns together, so a
-- county got glued onto names and cities ("Everbright CareFulton", city
-- "CherokeeAtlanta"), and a few rows got a county or page header as their
-- whole name ("Marion", "AAPPENDIX P"). This copies the name and city from
-- the Appendix P list updated 8/15/2026 (outreach/2026-09-appendix-p/) for
-- rows that:
--   * are unclaimed (claimed providers own their listing; left alone), and
--   * matched the state entry by name, or by phone where the Dec 2025 and
--     Aug 2026 state lists agree on who owns that phone.
-- Slugs are unchanged, so no URL moves. Each UPDATE is guarded on the old
-- value: a row someone has edited since is skipped, not overwritten.
-- Review list and the rows held back: docs/data-cleanup/2026-10-12/.

BEGIN;

